{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:00 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅堅守底線拒拍強姦戲份：我好抗拒，好驚  梁靖琪自爆拍強姦戲崩潰「個人癲咗」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1e11ffb875ad4bc723413b4b1249130/2026-10/20261023_ENT_ENT___1.png\"/>\n<p>陳瀅（Jeannie）日前作客由梁靖琪（Toby）主持的YouTube頻道《SpotiTalk》，她們在節目中談及女演員在影視作品背後的辛酸。除了大談台慶劇《璀璨之城》的大尺度演出之外，二人更在節目中剖析了演員面對強姦戲等極端情節時的巨大心理關口。入行多年的梁靖琪坦言，自己即使演戲多年，至今依然對拍攝床上戲及強姦戲存有強烈的心理恐懼，甚至曾因拍攝強姦戲份而導致心理崩潰，留下陰影。</p>\n<h2>梁靖琪拍強姦戲留陰影：好驚，個人癲咗</h2>\n<p>梁靖琪坦承，至今對強姦這類情節依然感到非常害怕，更自爆曾因拍強姦戲而導致心理崩潰。梁靖琪表示：「我做咗咁耐，我話畀你聽，我都會驚嘅，我都有啲……我記得我有次拍一套劇係畀人強姦，我個人係癲咗。我拍完好驚嘅。個人係好緊張，我頂唔順呀！拍完嗰幾日，我都係個人好驚。」陳瀅亦相當明白梁靖琪的感受，她表示：「雖然我哋係演員、係假（只是演戲），但好多時候演員我哋真係會用咗真嘅情感去做，所以嗰段時間真係……the feeling is bad（感覺不好）。」</p>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅作客由梁靖琪（Toby）主持的YouTube頻道《SpotiTalk》，分享拍攝《璀璨之城》大尺度戲份的感受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f560305e8a2af84fab5a9cf26b050bb/2026-10/VS--YouTube-TeaTalkwithTobyJeannieChanEp77Dontoverthink-YouTube-11_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪在節目中分享，至今仍對拍強姦戲感抗拒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/691ae51aa5fbfc175e6da2ea83a845a2/2026-10/VS--YouTube-TeaTalkwithTobyJeannieChanEp77Dontoverthink-YouTube-9_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪說：「我記得我有次拍一套劇係畀人強姦，我個人係癲咗。我拍完好驚嘅。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1b2e8dfb185acf199c06eea7780164e/2026-10/VS--YouTube-TeaTalkwithTobyJeannieChanEp77Dontoverthink-YouTube-8_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅底線是不拍強姦戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc6c99bcd4c7bc2256b9a294fb668a95/2026-10/VS--YouTube-TeaTalkwithTobyJeannieChanEp77Dontoverthink-YouTube-5_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅於《璀璨之城》的角色甘願犧牲肉體報仇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec2a0bf2664d3da794b445574fb1d008/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劇中陳瀅身穿內衣出鏡，其後更在張智霖面前脫下內衣全裸露背，「腿張開」畫面意識大膽引起熱話。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/069c4b785d8fff50b28620a68d4e9886/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"通訊局因這場戲份接獲25宗投訴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0a860436763614915049fcb334c21cf/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-40_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意識相當大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d29a5dfd593bded778b4c5d294d82103/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅在《璀璨之城》中貢獻大尺度畫面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/788683d4835a23c8b9991bcb0bc64722/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳瀅躺在床上腿張開，被張智霖拍下陳瀅私密照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adefb06c8d8aaa2aa0d4695f5ba845b2/2026-10/VS--4--myTVSUPER-41_32_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪成為人妻人母後，魅力更勝從前。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29348f71eb79f1a356a8da2e9e73ed70/2026-06/toby_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪婚後越來越靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68b40034334cb3d53d5f5a24646fc6f4/2026-06/toby_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪與第二任老公施雋賢拍拖近兩年決定結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb3ca77e3d40ed8848d1d5da6b6f507e/2025-02/tobyleungchingki_1738144152_3556133357895686418_1086696634.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪再婚七年，一家四口生活幸福。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd3b092da2045cbdf5f68948583d5a80/2025-02/tobyleungchingki_1738144152_3556133357887331611_1086696634.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪於2019年與拍拖近兩年的圈外男友施雋賢（Jonathan）再婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e393cc8ab6fa3996d8266fbeb0452941/2024-01/tobyleungchingki_1653133059_2843008618519824558_1086696634.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪為施雋賢誕下兩子施睿文（Roman）和細仔施睿安（Rian）後減產。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97f6f68bbd56ee60abc2646e7bd011d0/2024-02/415397089_18424292716040635_4058492790195993361_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪老公近日分享湊仔日常。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71a8e8fe0d070e5fcb69b397796dc58e/2026-09/Toby_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪老公為兒子在一堆名車前打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbf7d787d7b14c3b07e40516dabed753/2026-09/01_4_23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪的囝囝學打高爾夫球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ac10d103a48f59aea170c7bd17e6c8c/2026-09/Roman_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪的囝囝有板有眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd83398e90b597a8472f69f97cf96e3c/2026-09/Roman_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪夫婦栽培兒子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d0f1d092739c73d39097163325532374/2026-09/Roman_3_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳瀅底線是不拍強姦戲</h2>\n<p>面對如此考驗心理素質的爭議性情節，陳瀅則斬釘截鐵地表明，拍強姦戲是她無法逾越的終極底線，自己從心理上完全無法接受。陳瀅表示自己底線是不拍強姦戲：「我就未試過拍強姦戲。呢個反而係我自己一個底線嚟嘅，過唔到。但同時時間so far都未試過有人搵我拍一個角色係需要有呢一類嘅scenes。但我……唔得啊！唔知點解我好抗拒，我好驚。」</p>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪父親是金牌監製梁家樹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3dad9e339add4acf59fb676f401bf40d/2024-06/kk_9621.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁家樹與蕭笑鳴育有兩女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecb35b024ff244174d063bfc4c001506/2024-01/tobyleungchingki_1687100359_3127946986285353019_1086696634.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁家樹與太太蕭笑鳴已榮升外祖父母。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc1140f35a26241bc0b550109b4d1947/2023-08/dsc_9662.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪曾分享與姐姐慶生的合照，兩姐妹同樣高顏值。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09e7b678fdf9332f1cbab65b4c8149aa/2024-11/Photo_shared_by_Toby_Leung_on_November_18_2024_tagging_lafamillecake_and_bonniefer_leung_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪多次出演由爸爸梁家樹監製的劇集。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/355cea10da87b9d522e6ec3712fe7fa6/2024-06/dsc_0508.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪（Toby）曾是四人女子組合「女生宿舍」成員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a6a419b97f0ef884768cc717aa17fcae/2024-06/dcent61207072004.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪是「七魔女」成員之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0efb8bdbe9d9de85828af9f1e2bb5444/2025-02/tobyleungchingki_1731994546_3504546722171402184_1086696634.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪近年因《家族榮耀之繼承者》再度受到關注，演技終於獲得讚賞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/871daa58ad4f06845e8caebfca6e4c45/2024-06/13_19093177426663dbda4e0f4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪的兒子早前生病，她在IG分享兒子已出院回家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fdbb91c7a9f04cfb6b31ede89f882cdc/2025-11/leung03.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪兒子入醫院吸氧氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f54fdb582037191195ef452af87ff527/2025-11/leung01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"施雋賢上載了一段影片，大談作為家長的挑戰與感悟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4934aed728d108098b675e508e00d9a9/2025-09/VS----0_08__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"意外洩露他們一家四口居住的豪宅內部裝潢與格局。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/61caabb68b687ea9b9e1be3dc73b43fd/2025-09/VS----0_11__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"影片中曝光了單位內的長走廊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e6807d5ed090e390f971443db1b119f/2025-09/VS----0_14__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"睡床採用灰色絨布床頭板，配上白色格紋床單，設計簡約而溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa66ec8f8cbb3d86dec804cd55e89349/2025-09/VS----0_38_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孩子們在床上嬉戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4eabd8e5b9bc4cfc9f21a02f60745bf1/2025-09/VS----0_42__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疑似廚房位置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69c93bc2a192da755b77bbbeea1fd4e4/2025-09/VS----0_51_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳一旁可見落地大窗，設計簡潔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b591fce07aed20dfd1c32426b1d6619/2025-09/VS----1_03__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客飯廳空間感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92acf4e52cf23779ccad81bafa692128/2025-09/VS----1_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"片中更包括外遊入住酒店的影片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc195a2bd5744af04f92a8f5b8d0d9f1/2025-09/VS----1_47__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁靖琪於2011年與圈外男友黃敏豪（Aaron）閃婚，可惜婚姻僅維持兩年便離婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07b24318abdf69315ac0dd9c046f28f9/2025-02/maxresdefault_2.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:39.760096+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":635,"images":42,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T17:38:33.166107+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:39.477458+00:00","content_hash":"ca267de998d2cff7490f5fa8598a088ac5097e453e078dd3561eb75de9226322","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}